Package: coalr
Type: Package
Title: Fast Codon Alignment and dN/dS (Ka/Ks) with the 'COAL' C++ Engine
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chloe", "Newton", email = "chloenewton2323@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Keanu", "Murati", role = "aut"))
Description: In-process R bindings to the C++ core of 'COAL', a fast replacement for 'PAL2NAL'.
    Translates coding sequences, aligns the proteins (global Needleman-Wunsch with 'BLOSUM62'),
    threads the codons onto the protein alignment and estimates dN, dS and dN/dS (Ka/Ks) with the
    methods of Yang and Nielsen (2000), Nei and Gojobori (1986), Li, Wu and Luo (1985), Li (1993),
    Pamilo and Bianchi (1993), Tzeng, Pan and Li (2004) and Zhang, Li and Yu (2006), for pairs of
    orthologs or for every pair of the genes in a cluster, on several threads, without external
    programs or temporary files. An optional route through 'reticulate' runs the complete 'COAL'
    pipeline (with 'DIAMOND' and 'Clustal Omega') from R.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/Plumat-COAL/COAL
BugReports: https://github.com/Plumat-COAL/COAL/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
